      description: "Provides design guidelines for building polished, distinctive Android interfaces with Jetpack Compose. Use when building any Android app, screen, component, or user-facing UI. Also use when styling, beautifying, or improving the visual design of existing Android code. Helps the agent generate creative, production-grade code and Material 3 layouts that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics."
