  planner_response {
    response: "- **Completed:** Built **Pic To PDF**, a complete, production-grade native Android document scanner and PDF creator application in Kotlin and Jetpack Compose.\n- **Key Features Implemented:**\n  - **Camera & Photo Import:** Native CameraX document scanning with live preview and flash toggle, alongside Android Photo Picker for batch image import.\n  - **Page Editor & Enhancements:** Intuitive thumbnail manager for page reordering, rotation, deletion, and document filters (Grayscale, Black & White, Original).\n  - **PDF Generation Engine:** Powered by `android.graphics.pdf.PdfDocument` supporting custom paper sizes (A4, Letter, Legal), orientations, image fitting, quality presets, and margins.\n  - **Storage & Sharing:** Native Storage Access Framework (SAF) for local saving, `PdfRenderer` for document preview, and `FileProvider` for secure sharing.\n  - **Document History & Library:** Room database persistence for tracking and managing created PDFs.\n  - **UI & Polish:** Material Design 3 design system with light/dark theme support, custom adaptive app icon, and skippable first-launch onboarding.\n- **Files Changed:** `metadata.json`, `settings.gradle.kts`, `app/build.gradle.kts`, `AndroidManifest.xml`, `MainActivity.kt`, Room database, repository, preferences, PDF generator, image processor, domain models, and all UI screen composables.\n- **Verification:** Successfully compiled and verified the entire Android application build via `compile_applet`."
    thinking: "**Reviewing Accomplishments**\n\nThe applet built successfully, with zero errors! I\'ve successfully created a native Android document scanner and PDF creator application, **Pic To PDF**. I\'ve also implemented Material 3 theming for both light and dark modes. I\'m now taking stock of what was completed!\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "- **Completed:** Built **Pic To PDF**, a complete, production-grade native Android document scanner and PDF creator application in Kotlin and Jetpack Compose.\n- **Key Features Implemented:**\n  - **Camera & Photo Import:** Native CameraX document scanning with live preview and flash toggle, alongside Android Photo Picker for batch image import.\n  - **Page Editor & Enhancements:** Intuitive thumbnail manager for page reordering, rotation, deletion, and document filters (Grayscale, Black & White, Original).\n  - **PDF Generation Engine:** Powered by `android.graphics.pdf.PdfDocument` supporting custom paper sizes (A4, Letter, Legal), orientations, image fitting, quality presets, and margins.\n  - **Storage & Sharing:** Native Storage Access Framework (SAF) for local saving, `PdfRenderer` for document preview, and `FileProvider` for secure sharing.\n  - **Document History & Library:** Room database persistence for tracking and managing created PDFs.\n  - **UI & Polish:** Material Design 3 design system with light/dark theme support, custom adaptive app icon, and skippable first-launch onboarding.\n- **Files Changed:** `metadata.json`, `settings.gradle.kts`, `app/build.gradle.kts`, `AndroidManifest.xml`, `MainActivity.kt`, Room database, repository, preferences, PDF generator, image processor, domain models, and all UI screen composables.\n- **Verification:** Successfully compiled and verified the entire Android application build via `compile_applet`."
